@startuml
title NextBeats — Full Component Sequence
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #333

actor "User Browser" as Browser
participant "Client UI (Next.js)" as UI
participant "Client Cache / Prefetch" as Cache
participant "Next.js Server (App Router)" as NextApp
participant "Server Functions" as SF
participant "Audio Engine (lib/audio)" as Audio
participant "Prisma Client (lib/db.ts)" as Prisma
database "Postgres / SQLite (prisma)" as DB
participant "CDN / Edge Cache (optional)" as CDN
participant "Playwright (E2E)" as Playwright

== Navigation & Prefetch ==
Browser -> UI : hover / viewport triggers prefetch
activate UI
UI -> Cache : check client cache for prefetched App Shell
Cache --> UI : serve prefetched shell (instant)
UI -> NextApp : request route data (if not prefetched)
NextApp --> Cache : read server cache tag / cache components
Cache --> NextApp : cached fragments or miss
NextApp -> Prisma : read page hydrated data
Prisma -> DB : SELECT ...
DB --> Prisma : rows
Prisma --> NextApp : data
NextApp --> UI : render server component response
deactivate UI

== Play Track (start playback) ==
Browser -> UI : Click Play
activate UI
UI -> Audio : schedule and start playback (Web Audio API)
activate Audio
Audio -> UI : playback started (local)
note right of Audio
Audio scheduling and synthesis happens client-side.
Server only tracks analytic events.
end note
UI -> SF : fire-and-forget analytics event (optional)
activate SF
SF -> Prisma : insert play event
Prisma -> DB : INSERT
DB --> Prisma : OK
Prisma --> SF : success
SF --> UI : 202 Accepted (if awaited)
deactivate SF
Audio --> Browser : sound output
deactivate Audio

== Favorite Track (optimistic) ==
Browser -> UI : click Favorite (optimistic)
activate UI
UI -> SF : Server Function /api/favorite(trackId)
activate SF
SF -> Prisma : upsert favorite(user, track)
Prisma -> DB : write
DB --> Prisma : OK
Prisma --> SF : success
SF -> SF : updateTag("track:<id>")
SF --> UI : confirm favorite
deactivate SF
UI -> Cache : trigger selective revalidation
Cache --> UI : refreshed content on next navigation
deactivate UI

== Create Playlist (mutating data) ==
Browser -> UI : Create playlist form submit
activate UI
UI -> SF : /api/create-playlist(payload)
activate SF
SF -> Prisma : insert playlist + relations
Prisma -> DB : multiple INSERTs
DB --> Prisma : OK
Prisma --> SF : success
SF -> SF : updateTag("playlists:user:<id>")
SF --> UI : 201 Created
deactivate SF
UI -> Cache : request revalidation for playlist tag
Cache --> UI : new playlist visible after revalidation
deactivate UI

== Cache Invalidation & Revalidation Flow ==
SF -> CDN : (optional) purge edge cache or signal
SF -> Cache : updateTag(tag) -> mark cache entries stale
note right
Server Functions call updateTag to selectively revalidate
only affected cache components / pages.
end note
Cache --> NextApp : serve fresh content on next request

== E2E (Playwright) flow ==
Playwright -> Browser : start test with beats-user cookie
Playwright -> NextApp : start webServer (via pnpm dev)
Playwright -> Browser : drive UI (navigation, play, favorite)

@enduml